  "text": "cc-track's setup flow has multiple entry points: cc-track init creates the slash command, then the slash command runs setup-templates and setup-commands. The setup-templates command is responsible for creating the .claude directory structure and copying template files. Added tasks/ and plans/ directory creation here (lines 33-47 of setup-templates.ts). This ensures they exist before any hooks run. The walt project hit this bug because it went through setup before this fix.",
  "sections": [
    "Project Notes"
  ],
